    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22232" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλᾰμῠρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blear-eyed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁφθαλμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.116
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>; prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τυφλῶν πόλεϊ γ.
				βασιλεύει</span> 'dans le royaume des aveugles le borgne est
			roi', Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.192
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of birds,
			perh. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμυρός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				396
			</span></i> (but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνυγροβίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					232.44
				</span></i>
			). (With <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλαμάω, γλάμυξος
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;γλαμο-μ.</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, γλαμυρός, γλαμώδης</span>, cf. Lett.
				<i>glums</i> 'mucus', <i>glumt</i> 'become viscous', Engl.
				<i>clammy.</i>)</div>
